  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Vector components, addition and scalar multiples, and the magnitude of a vector.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Vectors",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Add componentwise: \\( (a_1,a_2)+(b_1,b_2)=(a_1+b_1,\\,a_2+b_2) \\). A scalar multiple stretches: \\( k(a_1,a_2)=(ka_1,ka_2) \\). Magnitude \\( |\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{a_1^{2}+a_2^{2}} \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Vector \\( \\mathbf{a}=(3,1) \\) is fixed (indigo). Slide the components of \\( \\mathbf{b} \\) (amber); the dashed line is the resultant \\( \\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b} \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Adding vectors",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvasId": "a2VecCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "Two vectors and their resultant",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
